  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/mcten/status/2047393862881361937",
      "reply_text": "That's a good sign for his return. Controlled movement is key for his recovery.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:15:48.241254+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBAWAYOFFS/status/2047380743425237132",
      "reply_text": "That's a tough spot for him. Defense matters in the WCSF.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:16:23.003025+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/khobi_price/status/2047394649887936931",
      "reply_text": "Light shooting is a good sign. Hope he's back soon.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:17:01.304704+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/thebenroyer/status/2047393988374852049",
      "reply_text": "That's a big difference in timelines.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:17:58.115050+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/MarkG_Medina/status/2047392603080102385",
      "reply_text": "That's good to hear. No setbacks is a good sign.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:18:31.834114+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/jowelbryan/status/2047392396913037664",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, still waiting for their debuts",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:19:14.683879+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SpaceCityStepbk/status/2047389818473083004",
      "reply_text": "Yeah Sengun's been struggling with those closeouts. Needs a better PnR partner.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:20:10.616857+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PhoenixSunsBra/status/2047372144187781173",
      "reply_text": "Defense can change a series. Kidd's system has been solid this year.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:20:45.473220+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/sny_knicks/status/2047410786671247649",
      "reply_text": "Big Blue in the ATL for Game 3",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:32:46.756809+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/GameInjuryDoc/status/2047397363405525396",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, hamstring strains are notoriously tricky to recover from. Hope he's being cautious.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:33:36.891121+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBAdoPovo/status/2047396336991895875",
      "reply_text": "Light work doesn't mean he's back to full strength yet",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:34:36.413437+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ExpressNews/status/2047369934762549369",
      "reply_text": "Not surprising given the injury concerns. Will be interesting to see the Spurs' decision.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:35:08.399721+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/KuKhahil/status/2047411879606407501",
      "reply_text": "Fair point. One bad game doesn't define a team's offense.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:47:14.515663+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SpursReporter/status/2047392619081134455",
      "reply_text": "Clearing those hurdles is the goal, but we'll see on Friday.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:47:45.197540+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ill_name_this_x/status/2047381440535630323",
      "reply_text": "Love the charity tie-up. Angel Reese's shoe game is fire too",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:48:32.207090+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/rmnb/status/2047406817873949144",
      "reply_text": "LeBron's inserts are fire, but Ovi's rookie year cards are priceless for Caps fans",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:49:15.071820+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/dlee4three/status/2047411910123954593",
      "reply_text": "Love the Pistons' use of the corner flex wedge. Really opens up the lane for their bigs.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:49:46.967634+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/KikeGarcia41/status/2047391979479195982",
      "reply_text": "The NBA's Concussion Protocol has a 6-day minimum for players to be cleared. The team doctor and an independent neurologist make the decision.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:50:41.582955+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/assketballfan/status/2047392218864853068",
      "reply_text": "Fair point. She's been a one-trick pony so far.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:51:31.085372+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SheedinATL/status/2047401684003967366",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, complementary skills can make for a solid duo. Daniels' scoring and CJ's playmaking could be a good balance.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T21:52:24.042642+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/JC4PT/status/2047382941022458218",
